    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "How much is too much for a morning cup of joe? Prices like £5 in London or $7 in New York may be unthinkable for some. However, this could soon be a reality. Around the world, coffee prices are "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". A surprising factor behind this is the world’s smelliest "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "—the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "durian",
            "zh": "榴梿"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "In 2021, an unusual frost destroyed coffee crops in Brazil, the world’s largest "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of Arabica beans. Buyers then had to turn to Vietnam, the main producer of Robusta beans. However, the country’s coffee-growing region saw its worst drought in nearly a decade. That "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " local coffee production badly. In general, climate change has had a negative effect on coffee plants. Bean yields have fallen sharply "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "On top of this, many farmers in Vietnam have begun "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " durian rather than coffee. High demand from China has made the smelly yellow fruit highly "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "profitable",
            "zh": "有利润的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Some farmers can earn up to 5 times as much for it. This year, Vietnam became the second biggest durian exporter to China. Meanwhile, coffee exports from Vietnam "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " by 50% in June."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Countries like Colombia and Ethiopia have increased their coffee production. But they haven’t been able to "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "fill the gap",
            "zh": "填补空缺"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". This has driven the prices of both Arabica and Robusta beans to near-record levels."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "This year’s coffee crop in Brazil will be very important, experts say. If the rains return early, the plants should be "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " enough. However, if the rains come late, next year’s crop will fail. That will keep coffee prices "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
